/signal /social 301
/sonics /music 301

# Astro here is static output with no adapter, so a dynamic [handle].astro
# route can't prerender unknown fan handles. Instead every /community/u/*
# path is rewritten (200, not a redirect) to the same static shell, which
# reads the handle from location.pathname and fetches it client-side.
# Placed after the two 301s above and scoped to /community/u/* specifically
# so it cannot shadow /community itself or those existing redirects.
/community/u/* /community/profile 200
